  artifactName: Tandang Sora Medicine Bowl
  artifactSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c66ab1f0e2ad6174083a3683677e5cc5, type: 3}
  plaqueTitle: Tandang Sora Medicine Bowl
  plaqueDescription: This bowl symbolizes the compassion and courage of Filipino
    women who provided food, shelter, and medical assistance to revolutionaries during
    the fight for independence.
  artifactInspectionDescription: Hammered from heavy solid brass with a flared lip.
    The polished interior retains subtle patina marks from ceremonial quill dips
    and wax seals.
